  "uprn": "100021580601",
  "decision_date": "17/03/2009",
  "description": "Erection of part single storey part 3 storey rear extension and erection of fourth floor (roof extension) incorporating alterations to provide an additional three flats and roof terraces (from 5 to 8 flats)",
  "site_name": "124-126",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "31/07/2008",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "W4 1PU",
  "street_name": "Chiswick High Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "lapsed_date": "16/03/2012",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - Before the development is commenced a scheme for protecting the proposed residential accommodation from excessive external noise and noise transmission between floors shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and any works which form part of such a scheme shall be completed before any part of the development is first occupied or used.",
    "Condition : 5 - Separate access to the residential accommodation on the upper floors of the premises shall be available to residents at all times.",
    "Condition : 6 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8.00am  to 6.00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9.00am  to 1.00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - Details of any securoty and safety shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the flats are occupied.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details."
  ],
